use in LaTeX: \documentclass[upint,hyphenate,mono,var0,japanese,greek,vietnamese,arabic,bengali,chinese-simplified,chinese-traditional,chinese,hindi,korean,marathi,tamil]{asmeconf}
structure (in the LaTeX user's own terms):
  documentclass options: upint, hyphenate, mono, var0, japanese, greek, vietnamese, arabic, bengali, chinese-simplified, chinese-traditional, chinese, hindi, korean, marathi, tamil, * (catch-all)
