        `\KOMAScriptVersion', we suggest to do\MessageBreak
        an update of KOMA-Script or maybe even the whole\MessageBreak
        TeX distribution%
      }%
    }{%
      \edef\reserved@a{\the\numexpr\@tempcnta-4\relax/%
        \ifnum\@tempcntb<10 0\fi\the\@tempcntb/01}%
