notes: .sty file(s) included because the class requires them as its body: tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-common/10_5.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-common/ob-koreanappendix.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-common/ob-nokoreanappendix.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-common/ob-toclof.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-ucs/hfontsel.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-ucs/memhangul-ucs.sty, tex/latex/kotex-oblivoir/memhangul-ucs/nanumfontsel.sty
