\ProvidesExplPackage {luatex-cn-core} {2026/10/29} {0.4.3} {Core features for luatex-cn}

% Version info — derived from \ProvidesExplPackage above (single source of truth)
\tl_const:Nn \c_luatexcn_core_version_tl {0.4.3}
