@metadata
corpus: templates
title: CTAN document classes as phextura templates
provenance: enumerated once from the CTAN class topic page (https://www.ctan.org/topic/class); sources harvested from the TeX Live tlnet distribution archives on mirror.ctan.org (the pre-packaged copy of CTAN) — no per-package web pages were scraped. Licenses are each package's own, recorded per template in its header scroll (from the class source header when stated there, else TeX Live packaging metadata). This corpus redistributes the classes under their own licenses, with provenance per template.
layout: corpus home at 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.1 (index of every template and every gap); templates in Collection 4 (styles), Volume 1, one Book per template in package/class order; within a Book, Chapter 1 Section 1: Scroll 1 is the template header, the following scrolls are the class's source files verbatim in header order. A source file that is not valid UTF-8 text free of phext delimiter bytes is base64-hoisted and its header says so (phext binary canon).
counts: 449 packages enumerated, 595 templates, 51 gaps.
